      : isAmericanLowerHub
      ? 'These ten trip options are endpoint pairs along one Lower American River reach: Sailor Bar/Illinois, Upper Sunrise, Harrington, Watt Avenue, and Howe Avenue. Choose any pair in the selector; the overview groups representative trips by distance.'
      : isRussianRiverHub
      ? 'Start with the named Asti–Alexander and Alexander Valley–Healdsburg upper runs, the Healdsburg–Wohler or Mirabel middle reach, or a lower beach-to-beach trip. The hub keeps every endpoint combination available so you can choose a shorter exit or a longer day.'
      : isBayouDeViewHub
      ? 'The AGFC water trail runs 15.2 miles south from Benson Creek Access to Bank of Brinkley Access. Start with that full route or one of the named shorter sections; the trip selector keeps five other endpoint combinations available with their own access and distance details.'
      : isGreenRiverHub
      ? 'Choose among the Upper Green from Tailwater toward Greensburg, the spring-fed Hart County reaches from Lynn Camp to Stovall Park, or the Mammoth Cave trips from Dennison Ferry through Houchin Ferry to Brownsville. Each zone has different access and condition guidance; the hub keeps all 32 endpoint choices available.'
      : isMillersHub
